## tz/tzdata: bundled zone table (current-era recurring rules)
##
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
## Mirrors the role of V's `time.tzdata`: embedded data backing the engine
## in `../engine.alya`. Rules are recurring current-era schedules, not full
## IANA histories: fixed zones are exact going forward, DST zones follow
## their post-2007 (US) / post-1996 (EU) / current southern rules.
## Pre-changeover historical dates are out of scope for v0.1.0.

import "../types.alya"

## Returns the bundled zone rule table.
##
## ### Parameters
## None.
##
## ### Returns
## Array of `TzRule` covering the v0.1.0 zone set.
pub function tzdata_rules() -> array
